From 158aae8f4be8c531b079dfc5e651eb21840a7251 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arthur Clark <mydevstuff@mail.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 14:11:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/33] QNX: extend the LOK render gate to cover Calc

Add a flat-ODF spreadsheet case (data/calc.fods) to the render-regression
gate. sc renders it through the same documentLoad/paintTile path as the
Writer cases; the spreadsheet paints a fixed top-left twip region so the
populated cells fill the tile instead of shrinking to nothing over the whole
sheet. The Writer cases are unchanged and the gate still passes.

Change-Id: I65f861e565fa58fa57bdad29e12762b7f150b513
---
 libreofficekit/qa/qnxrendergate/README        |  6 ++--
 .../qa/qnxrendergate/data/calc.fods           | 34 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../qa/qnxrendergate/rendergate.cxx           | 24 ++++++++-----
 3 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 libreofficekit/qa/qnxrendergate/data/calc.fods

diff --git a/libreofficekit/qa/qnxrendergate/README b/libreofficekit/qa/qnxrendergate/README
index dd5568ea7..b9bed8481 100644
--- a/libreofficekit/qa/qnxrendergate/README
+++ b/libreofficekit/qa/qnxrendergate/README
@@ -5,5 +5,7 @@ QNX LibreOfficeKit render-regression gate.
 Renders a 256x256 tile of each data/ document through LibreOfficeKit and checks
 the non-white pixel count against a per-document band: the floor rejects a blank
 tile, the ceiling rejects a garbage one. data/bad.odt is a negative control that
-must fail to render. Substitutes the upstream tiledrendering/smoketest tests,
-which are unusable here (disabled/bit-rotted, and a whole-office build).
+must fail to render. Covers Writer (hello.docx, clean.odt) and Calc (calc.fods,
+flat ODF; painted over a fixed top-left twip region so the cells fill the tile).
+Substitutes the upstream tiledrendering/smoketest tests, which are unusable here
+(disabled/bit-rotted, and a whole-office build).
